# z3660scsi: its .moddata keys (amix-dlm C3-1 section 3, C4-2 section 1) and
# the definition line, as the ABI kit's mkmod reads a Master.  One Master for
# both lines: no $cpu, the kit's fragment gives the line's (68030 on k30,
# 68040 on k46); kabi and cc come from the kit.
# $class root: loaded by the core's root pass (marc_root) before the root is
# mounted; a root-class module is never unloaded ($unload never).
# $match: the AutoConfig board, or the AGA fixed-base window 0x10000000
# (autoconfig_rtg NO) = mobo:z3660-window; z3660scsi_load's own probe decides.
# $rank z3660: sd's class 1 (C4-1 section 4), the argument z3660scsi_load
# passes to sd_register.  No $majors: sd owns the disk majors.
# $modtype misc: MOD_HDRV_WRAPPER, no switch-table slot.
$modtype misc
$class root
$match zorro:144b:01,mobo:z3660-window
$rank z3660
$unload never
$desc Z3660 SCSI (piscsi mailbox), root-class disk controller
z3660scsi	z3660scsi
